{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiosk Simulator is an action-packed comedic take on the hustles of running a big city kiosk and the nostalgia of reaching that lone open kiosk on a rainy late night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/cabd2c4a98930a5b7ad861c10ee549e2.poster.avif?t=1757668574\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/cabd2c4a98930a5b7ad861c10ee549e2.webm?t=1757668574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/cabd2c4a98930a5b7ad861c10ee549e2.mp4?t=1757668574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roleplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a kiosk\u2019s owner in Cologne, Germany.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restock, serve customers, maintain and protect your kiosk against robbery and vandalism!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vibrant Cast and Dynamic Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each customer could be a loyal customer, a potential shoplifter or even a troublemaker!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty Curve</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tougher antagonists/bosses might take away your hard-earned cash - so be prepared for a challenge!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/d90b6dde75e477761a65e83880603d18.poster.avif?t=1757668574\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/d90b6dde75e477761a65e83880603d18.webm?t=1757668574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/d90b6dde75e477761a65e83880603d18.mp4?t=1757668574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restock the Kiosk with better products</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade to new furniture and better security</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2727430?t=1757668574","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2727430?t=1757668574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/6c0d64ecea2e4561c79a8581edd2f1a4855c1555/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757668574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/6c0d64ecea2e4561c79a8581edd2f1a4855c1555/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757668574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"You will get into fights with some people that enter your Kiosk"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3113700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiosk Simulator is an action-packed comedic take on the hustles of running a big city kiosk and the nostalgia of reaching that lone open